{"id":"e55a4d03b99a537e","group":"91","path":"91/91-cor-KF-non-conservative.md","title":"标准KF对PA非保守","display":"cor-KF-non-conservative — 标准KF对PA非保守","type":"corollary","metadata":{"type":"corollary","book":"Axiomatic Theories of Truth","book_abbrev":"91","label":"91-cor-KF-non-conservative","aliases":["91-cor-KF-non-conservative"],"display":"cor-KF-non-conservative — 标准KF对PA非保守","depends_on":["[[91-df-KF]]","[[91-thm-KF-proves-PA-consistency]]","[[91-df-conservative-truth]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"corollary"},{"key":"book","html":"Axiomatic Theories of Truth"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"91"},{"key":"label","html":"91-cor-KF-non-conservative"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>91-cor-KF-non-conservative</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"cor-KF-non-conservative — 标准KF对PA非保守"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"a0a2284f96eaea1d\" href=\"?note=a0a2284f96eaea1d\" title=\"91-df-KF\">91-df-KF</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"a295446296ee06c0\" href=\"?note=a295446296ee06c0\" title=\"91-thm-KF-proves-PA-consistency\">91-thm-KF-proves-PA-consistency</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"4a1d989a5f615933\" href=\"?note=4a1d989a5f615933\" title=\"91-df-conservative-truth\">91-df-conservative-truth</a></span></div>"}],"html":"<h1 id=\"cor-KF-non-conservative-—-标准-KF-对-PA-非保守\">cor-KF-non-conservative — 标准 KF 对 PA 非保守</h1>\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{KF}\">\\(\\mathrm{KF}\\)</span> (带全 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal L_T\">\\(\\mathcal L_T\\)</span>-归纳的标准 Kripke–Feferman 理论)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{PA}\">\\(\\mathrm{PA}\\)</span> (一致、可递归公理化且包含足够算术的 Peano 算术)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Sent}_{\\mathcal L_0}\">\\(\\mathrm{Sent}_{\\mathcal L_0}\\)</span> (算术语言句子集)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Con}(\\mathrm{PA})\">\\(\\operatorname{Con}(\\mathrm{PA})\\)</span> (PA 的标准一致性句)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{cor\\text{-}KF\\text{-}non\\text{-}conservative}\\vdash\n\\left[\n\\operatorname{Con}(\\mathrm{PA})\n\\land\n\\mathrm{KF}\\vdash\\operatorname{Con}(\\mathrm{PA})\n\\right]\n\\to\n\\exists\\varphi\\in\\mathrm{Sent}_{\\mathcal L_0}\\,\n\\bigl(\\mathrm{KF}\\vdash\\varphi\\land\\mathrm{PA}\\nvdash\\varphi\\bigr),\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{cor\\text{-}KF\\text{-}non\\text{-}conservative}\\vdash\n\\left[\n\\operatorname{Con}(\\mathrm{PA})\n\\land\n\\mathrm{KF}\\vdash\\operatorname{Con}(\\mathrm{PA})\n\\right]\n\\to\n\\exists\\varphi\\in\\mathrm{Sent}_{\\mathcal L_0}\\,\n\\bigl(\\mathrm{KF}\\vdash\\varphi\\land\\mathrm{PA}\\nvdash\\varphi\\bigr),\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>其中见证可取 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\varphi=\\operatorname{Con}(\\mathrm{PA})\">\\(\\varphi=\\operatorname{Con}(\\mathrm{PA})\\)</span>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>Gödel 第二不完备定理在上述条件下给出\n<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{PA}\\nvdash\\operatorname{Con}(\\mathrm{PA})\">\\(\\mathrm{PA}\\nvdash\\operatorname{Con}(\\mathrm{PA})\\)</span>；标准 KF 借助\n含真理谓词的归纳证明 PA 证明规则保持真性，因而证明\n<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Con}(\\mathrm{PA})\">\\(\\operatorname{Con}(\\mathrm{PA})\\)</span>。这里的结论针对标准的全归纳 KF；\n不能把它无条件推广到所有名为 “KF” 的弱变体。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"cor-KF-non-conservative-—-标准-KF-对-PA-非保守","text":"cor-KF-non-conservative — 标准 KF 对 PA 非保守","level":1},{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"91-df-KF","status":"resolved","id":"a0a2284f96eaea1d","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[91-df-KF]]","embed":false},{"target":"91-thm-KF-proves-PA-consistency","status":"resolved","id":"a295446296ee06c0","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[91-thm-KF-proves-PA-consistency]]","embed":false},{"target":"91-df-conservative-truth","status":"resolved","id":"4a1d989a5f615933","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[91-df-conservative-truth]]","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"\\mathrm{KF}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathcal L_T","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{PA}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Sent}_{\\mathcal L_0}","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{Con}(\\mathrm{PA})","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{cor\\text{-}KF\\text{-}non\\text{-}conservative}\\vdash\n\\left[\n\\operatorname{Con}(\\mathrm{PA})\n\\land\n\\mathrm{KF}\\vdash\\operatorname{Con}(\\mathrm{PA})\n\\right]\n\\to\n\\exists\\varphi\\in\\mathrm{Sent}_{\\mathcal L_0}\\,\n\\bigl(\\mathrm{KF}\\vdash\\varphi\\land\\mathrm{PA}\\nvdash\\varphi\\bigr),","display":true},{"tex":"\\varphi=\\operatorname{Con}(\\mathrm{PA})","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{PA}\\nvdash\\operatorname{Con}(\\mathrm{PA})","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{Con}(\\mathrm{PA})","display":false}],"bytes":1410,"backlinks":[],"outgoing":["a0a2284f96eaea1d","a295446296ee06c0","4a1d989a5f615933"]}